# DEV (construction coverage). Written by the engine's author while building: every question / statement construction the engine is expected to handle for the
# relation inventory, in several wordings each. This file is TUNED ON; it measures construction coverage, not generalisation (see reports/FINAL_REPORT.md for the
# independent blind sets). Format: ID | category | text | gold
